{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Baby Formula: Tiny Hands, Big Tasks",
    "steam_appid": 2877280,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/1d69663acf89692d6b8f6faa2e409172.avif?t=1718779891\" width=616 height=266 /></span><br><br>Baby Formula is a charming couch co-op game where you and your friends become a group of determined babies set on performing household chores. With adults glued to their screens, the cake-baking, lawn-mowing, and tire-changing duties fall into the tiny, clumsy hands of the babies.<br><br>Steering these lovable ragdolls isn't easy. These pint-sized pranksters stumble around, making it tricky to coordinate your own actions, let alone work together with your teammates. You'll aim to pour cream into a bowl only to watch it splatter on the floor. The lawn mower might trim the flowerbed instead of the grass. Avoid putting screwdrivers into electrical outlets! But with teamwork and a bit of luck, you might just follow the to-do list and set a new high score. It\u2019s messy, it\u2019s janky, and it\u2019s hilariously fun! If you love ragdoll physics and cooperative chaos, Baby Formula is the game for you.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/32354720e187c1317fbca929b9418d52.poster.avif?t=1718779891\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/32354720e187c1317fbca929b9418d52.webm?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/32354720e187c1317fbca929b9418d52.mp4?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>These cute little troublemakers love to play with water, electricity, and other risky items, but don\u2019t worry \u2013 they\u2019re safe from harm!<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/ef04c0d44aca2d585eb90c06c2f1f87d.poster.avif?t=1718779891\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/ef04c0d44aca2d585eb90c06c2f1f87d.webm?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/ef04c0d44aca2d585eb90c06c2f1f87d.mp4?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The more you try to keep things tidy, the messier it gets. Liquids love to spread across the floor, creating a delightful chaos!<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/39377dc50ee6ccbee60f07adbff1c0b0.poster.avif?t=1718779891\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/39377dc50ee6ccbee60f07adbff1c0b0.webm?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/39377dc50ee6ccbee60f07adbff1c0b0.mp4?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After a fun-filled day of chores, your little angels will inevitably doze off in the sandbox, dreaming of the next big adventure!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/1d69663acf89692d6b8f6faa2e409172.avif?t=1718779891\" width=616 height=266 /></span><br><br>Baby Formula is a charming couch co-op game where you and your friends become a group of determined babies set on performing household chores. With adults glued to their screens, the cake-baking, lawn-mowing, and tire-changing duties fall into the tiny, clumsy hands of the babies.<br><br>Steering these lovable ragdolls isn't easy. These pint-sized pranksters stumble around, making it tricky to coordinate your own actions, let alone work together with your teammates. You'll aim to pour cream into a bowl only to watch it splatter on the floor. The lawn mower might trim the flowerbed instead of the grass. Avoid putting screwdrivers into electrical outlets! But with teamwork and a bit of luck, you might just follow the to-do list and set a new high score. It\u2019s messy, it\u2019s janky, and it\u2019s hilariously fun! If you love ragdoll physics and cooperative chaos, Baby Formula is the game for you.<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/32354720e187c1317fbca929b9418d52.poster.avif?t=1718779891\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/32354720e187c1317fbca929b9418d52.webm?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/32354720e187c1317fbca929b9418d52.mp4?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>These cute little troublemakers love to play with water, electricity, and other risky items, but don\u2019t worry \u2013 they\u2019re safe from harm!<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/ef04c0d44aca2d585eb90c06c2f1f87d.poster.avif?t=1718779891\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/ef04c0d44aca2d585eb90c06c2f1f87d.webm?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/ef04c0d44aca2d585eb90c06c2f1f87d.mp4?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The more you try to keep things tidy, the messier it gets. Liquids love to spread across the floor, creating a delightful chaos!<br><br>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/39377dc50ee6ccbee60f07adbff1c0b0.poster.avif?t=1718779891\" width=400 height=224 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/39377dc50ee6ccbee60f07adbff1c0b0.webm?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2877280/extras/39377dc50ee6ccbee60f07adbff1c0b0.mp4?t=1718779891\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>After a fun-filled day of chores, your little angels will inevitably doze off in the sandbox, dreaming of the next big adventure!",
    "short_description": "Gather your friends and guide a team of mischievous babies as they tackle household tasks like baking, washing the car, or mowing the lawn. Carry and drag objects, solve physics puzzles, and try not to make a mess (you will definitely make a mess). Try to finish before daddy's done doomscrolling!",
